  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/AJLCOBN.png\" alt=\"doorsmcw\" width=\"1299\" height=\"683\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCc_kqzt253fnG2RHW_CZL2A\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/youtube/channel/subscribers/UCc_kqzt253fnG2RHW_CZL2A?label=Youtube&style=for-the-badge\" width=\"138\" height=\"22\"></a><a href=\"https://twitter.com/sketch_macaw\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/- -ffffff\" width=\"15\" height=\"28\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/twitter/follow/sketch_macaw?color=6eb7ec&label=Twitter&logo=twitter&style=for-the-badge\" width=\"119\" height=\"28\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/- -ffffff\" width=\"15\" height=\"28\"></a><a href=\"https://discord.gg/Jmpdj8W\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/645360921673465857?color=a97db2&logo=discord&logoColor=f&style=for-the-badge\" width=\"181\" height=\"28\"></a><a href=\"https://github.com/sketchmacaw/MacawsModsIssues/wiki\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/- -ffffff\" width=\"15\" height=\"28\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/-Crafting Recipes-bc8f56?style=for-the-badge\" width=\"154\" height=\"28\"></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/GUtHhCc.png\" alt=\"blueline\" width=\"1920\" height=\"17\"></p>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/A1pclRa.png\" alt=\"about\" width=\"162\" height=\"43\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">你是否希望每个原版门都有更多木材变体？或者你只是想添加一些独特的新门？</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">如果是的话，我为你带来 Macaw's Doors（麦考之门）。此模组让你能够用每种木材制作原版门，</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">并拥有全新的木材颜色。此外还包含了一些新门，例如：障子门、金属门、牢狱门、现代风格门等等！</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">欢迎在此评论区或&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size:14px\">在我们的 Macaw Discord 频道提出你的想法。</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/GUtHhCc.png\" alt=\"blueline\" width=\"1920\" height=\"17\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/zQ7I8me.png\" alt=\"video\" width=\"340\" height=\"47\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/ZS7r7pqZzYg?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fsketchmacaw\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Macaw/BH_MxBH_PromoCard.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"647\" height=\"144\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">需要服务器吗？点击上方图片，使用我们的代码 <strong>sketchmacaw</strong> 首月立减 <strong>25%</strong>，尽情游玩吧！</p>\n<p>&nbsp;<img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/GUtHhCc.png\" alt=\"blueline\" width=\"1920\" height=\"17\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/EpKoS1L.png\" alt=\"faq\" width=\"163\" height=\"50\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">问：有计划将其移植到 1.15.2 及更低版本吗？</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">答：可能性极低，但未来或许会推出最后一个 1.12.2 版本……</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">问：我可以将你们的模组放入我的整合包中吗？</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">答：可以，只需注明出处并附上 CurseForge 页面链接即可。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">问：我有翻译内容想提供给你们，应该发到哪里？</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">答：可以发送到 GitHub 或我们的 Discord 服务器。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/tpZJ9zN.png\" width=\"1125\" height=\"1477\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
